            "review_text": "Passarinha-88\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam17 contributions\n2\nGreat jerk chicken!!!!\nJul 2019 • Friends\nVery tasty jerk chicken and great foods with reggae BGM! Start up restaurant so better to contact owner/chef before you go. It doesn't have signboard outside and little bit hard to find but it's nice and cozy restaurant and friendly staff! It is in the small alley behind Screc tower with Coop mart. They don't have their own drink for now and we will order from neighbor Vietnamese restaurant :-)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 19, 2019",
