            "review_title": "Review at Jamaica Jamaica",
            "review_text": "Marvin Brown\n1 contribution\n0\nAuthentic Jamaican food in Vietnam of all places\nJun 2019 • Friends\nThe food is tasty, and reminds me of the food from my local yard food shop in Birmingham. The decor of the place is cosy, and it helps having some sweet sweet reggae music playing the background. Portion sizes are very generous. I wanted jerk Chicken that day, but in order to save on food wastage I was informed that they are doing set menus, which was a bit disappointing, but the brown stew chicken I handmade me soon forget about that, and now I will simply return on the days I know they have the jerk out. Highly recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 2, 2019\nJamaica Jamaica - Caribbean BBQ/Cuisine\nThanks for your comments. Very much appreciated.\nWritten July 3, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
